vs 'free' shows fragmentation.␀␀␀Memory detail␀␀␀System Information␀␀Share channel␀␀␀ï¹  %s␀32-hex secret. Anyone with this can read the channel.␀␀␀Copy secret␀GPS sets the position while it has a fix␀␀␀␀Enter a rough location first␀␀␀␀Save position␀␀␀Move the map to your spot␀␀␀Hidden network␀␀Join network␀␀␀␀Network name (SSID)␀Network name␀␀␀␀Password (empty = open)␀Saved network␀␀␀Auto-Join␀␀␀Forget network␀␀ï€•␀/lock/placeholder.png␀␀␀Find␀␀␀␀Files␀␀␀Open a JPEG, then tap 'Set as background'␀␀␀Too large to edit (>8 KB)␀␀␀Already exists␀␀Create failed␀␀␀Time zone␀␀␀+00:00␀␀îƒ¨␀+1 h␀␀␀␀-1 h␀␀␀␀Used only when the time zone is Custom (UTC offset).␀␀␀␀Custom UTC offset␀␀␀12-hour clock␀␀␀Set the time␀␀␀␀Sync clock from system␀␀By hand (local time)␀␀␀␀Set clock␀␀␀After a cold start␀␀Joins a saved network briefly at boot just to set the clock.␀␀␀␀Sync time from saved Wi-Fi␀␀Allow open networks for it␀␀ï±␀If you forget your PIN, you have to reset the device␀␀␀␀It is the only way back in, and it erases everything on it: contacts, channels, messages and settings. Nobody can unlock it for you.␀␀␀␀I understand␀␀␀␀Wrong PIN␀␀␀PIN lock off␀␀␀␀The PINs did not match␀␀PIN lock on␀PIN changed␀123␀#unknown␀␀␀␀Push-to-talk␀␀␀␀Encrypted message␀␀␀#%s ␀␀␀␀%s: ␀␀␀␀No backups available to restore.␀␀␀␀Import settings␀Welcome to WADAMESH␀Let's set up your device.

